    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The target reduces the damage it takes by 4d8. Then, at the end of each of its turns, it loses 1d8 Hit Points, until it has lost a total of 4d8 Hit Points (roll these 4d8 separately from the damage reduction).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bW3H4M75txX4dK16\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Damage Reduction</em> rolls the amount to subtract from the damage; <em>Delayed Total</em> rolls the Hit Points to lose over the following turns, 1d8 at a time with <em>Delayed Loss</em>.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
